CHAPTER.VERS:
and he said, When you

          {+}
         do the office of a midwife to the Hebrew women, and see them on the birth-stool; if it is a son, then you

          {+}
         will kill him; but if it is a daughter, then she will live.

And the king of Egypt called for the midwives, and said to them, Why have you

          {+}
         done this thing, and have saved the men-children alive?

And Pharaoh charged all his people, saying, Every son who is born you

          {+}
         will cast into the river, and every daughter you

          {+}
         will save alive.
